\begin_layout Title
GreenREFORM-EU 3 Architecture
\end_layout

\begin_layout Author
Martin Kirk Bonde
\end_layout

\begin_layout Date
August 2026
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
In this document, I outline a new version of the GreenREFORM model system. The document is extremely terse — written to be readable by experts, without fluff or trivial details that make it harder to grasp the big picture. We assume close familiarity with optimizing representative agent models.
\end_layout

